- `Account.Name` is a required field at the platform level even when NPSP auto-naming is in play, so the insert failed with `REQUIRED_FIELD_MISSING`. The class now supplies a temporary placeholder name solely to satisfy the DML — NPSP's household naming trigger overwrites it with the real auto-generated household name (and greetings) on insert, so the service still does not name the household itself.

